{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31718","headline":"斋中 · 贾岛","name":"斋中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眈静非谬爲，本性实疎索。\n斋中一就枕，不觉白日落。\n低扉碍轩辔，寡德谢接诺。\n丛菊在墙阴，秋穷未开萼。\n所餐类病马，动影似移岳。\n欲驻迫逃衰，岂殊乱绠缚。\n已见饱时雨，应丰蔬与药。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}